### 0 cli render savings.wtf --format text
$ wtf render savings.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[$1,200]:saved
[9]:months_left
[saved_by_june] := monthly * months_left + saved = $5,000
[monthly] := solve(saved_by_june >= $5,000) = $422.22
Save [monthly] $422.22 a month.

