### 7 cli render broken.wtf --format text
$ wtf render broken.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
[unrelated] := solve(3 >= 2)
[loose] := solve(loose + missing >= 2)
[a] := b
[b] := a
[cyclic] := solve(a >= 1)
--- stderr
<root>/broken.wtf:1:22: error: The constraint does not depend on unrelated
<root>/broken.wtf:2:26: error: Unknown name 'missing'
<root>/broken.wtf:3:2: error: Dependency cycle: a → b → a
<root>/broken.wtf:4:8: error: Dependency cycle through a
wtf: 4 error(s) while rendering

